                              "content": "Verification is derived from provider presence, not configured directly. With no Resend key there is nothing to send the link with, so requiring verification would lock every new account out of an app it could never get into. It switches on by itself the moment a key exists.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.55,
                              "fontFamily": "Montserrat",
                              "fontSize": 13,
                              "fontWeight": "500"
