                  "content": "It is a record, not monitoring: there are deliberately no volume thresholds, no per-actor profiling and no alerting, because reading many members’ notes in one sitting is what safety work looks like. It exists so that “who saw my medical information?” has an honest answer and an incident can be reconstructed.",
