                                      "name": "Scope Today",
                                      "fill": "$muted-foreground",
                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                      "width": "fill_container",
                                      "content": "Nothing in the console is filed under a department yet, so a department-scoped delete permits nothing until an entity declares one. An org-wide role is what deletes today.",
