                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "RqIcf",
                      "name": "Side Note",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "gap": 8,
                      "padding": [
                        2,
                        0,
                        0,
                        0
                      ],
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "wUC5A",
                          "name": "N1",
                          "fill": "$muted-foreground",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "WHY THE PREVIEW IS THERE",
                          "fontFamily": "Montserrat",
                          "fontSize": 10,
                          "fontWeight": "700",
                          "letterSpacing": 1.1
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "D6onBL",
                          "name": "N2",
                          "fill": "$muted-foreground",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "The union is computed by the same resolver the server refuses with, so the console cannot promise an access it would then deny. The action re-checks server-side regardless — this is honesty, not authorisation.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.55,
                          "fontFamily": "Montserrat",
                          "fontSize": 12,
                          "fontWeight": "500"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "gzpWL",
                          "name": "N3",
                          "fill": "$muted-foreground",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Only a system manager sees these controls. Granting console access and assigning roles is the one capability no role may carry, so it cannot be handed out — which is what makes every other permission safe to edit.",
